{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-16","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers be prime to one another, the second will not be to any other number as the first is to the second.","book":9,"number":16,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.16","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.16/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":16,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-16@raw-52048b84e3c6cbde","contentId":"euclid-9-16","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52048b84e3c6cbde0d4c633d7638639896486e8f2b3bd13aac3f17a2791b6f34","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-16.statement","euclid-9-16.construction.1","euclid-9-16.proof.1","euclid-9-16.proof.2","euclid-9-16.proof.3","euclid-9-16.conclusion","euclid-9-16.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-16.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-16","revisionId":"euclid-9-16@raw-52048b84e3c6cbde","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5cecf1a54109ab1833d17e0575c40be3116478fab44352f7860e298898cea932","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers be prime to one another, the second will not be to any other number as the first is to the second."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个号码是互素,第二个号码将不再是任何其他号码,因为第一个号码是第二个号码。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-16.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-16","revisionId":"euclid-9-16@raw-52048b84e3c6cbde","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5224db30e4223d56914bb77cf2602c8e0237d63184a7f4dfecc76417ac4a3425","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two numbers A, B be prime to one another; I say that B is not to any other number as A is to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设 A 与 B 是两个互素的整数。要证明：不存在另一个整数，使 B 与该整数之比等于 A 与 B 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-16.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-16","revisionId":"euclid-9-16@raw-52048b84e3c6cbde","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d573646d1a7af93c310e32f4c11c6fb91777c687caf334b5741c0713ab733429","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, as A is to B, so let B be to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"反设存在整数 C，使 A 与 B 之比等于 B 与 C 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-16.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-16","revisionId":"euclid-9-16@raw-52048b84e3c6cbde","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0269ae2be211cc5ba58f854cffd841fc8be3a9a9fa38087d3d60ed43f91cef6","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now A, B are prime, primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least numbers measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent; [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] therefore A measures B as antecedent antecedent."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在A,B是初级, 质数也是最低的, 而最小的整除个 , 相同比例的 相同次数, 前身和随之而来; 因此, A, 整除, B 是一个前身。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-16.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-16","revisionId":"euclid-9-16@raw-52048b84e3c6cbde","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"374b0cb5d9eb193029238f161edf0fbf748b79addf777f3486db95d98b8d79fd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures itself; therefore A measures A, B which are prime to one another: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它本身也整除;因此,A 整除 A,B, 即互素:这是荒谬的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-16.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-16","revisionId":"euclid-9-16@raw-52048b84e3c6cbde","order":5,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77d08c41167a8a6638fa6b42cd065d00e502f2c6f6ce6284e33b1fe0e5a7112f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore B will not be to C, as A is to B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此，B 与 C 之比不可能等于 A 与 B 之比。证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-16.source","contentId":"euclid-9-16","revisionId":"euclid-9-16@raw-52048b84e3c6cbde","order":6,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47cd62663df20dd44e23549a48268cbe1d6d1c24ed9e817dc302cec2095289a7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.16/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.16\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-16:euclid-7-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-16.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"VII. 21"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-16:euclid-7-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-16.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"VII. 20"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-18:euclid-9-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-18.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"IX. 16"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-16:euclid-7-21:explicit","id":"euclid-7-21","book":7,"number":21,"kind":"proposition","title":"互素整数给出既约比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-16:euclid-7-20:explicit","id":"euclid-7-20","book":7,"number":20,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：最小公倍数与比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-18:euclid-9-16:explicit","id":"euclid-9-18","book":9,"number":18,"kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must n